WEBVTT

00:00:01.022 --> 00:00:09.228
Namaste. Is video mein hum The Ray ke naye GST features dekhenge. Ye public demo dummy data par based hai.

00:00:09.228 --> 00:00:21.382
Business customer ke liye B2B bill, kisi aur company ke GSTIN par bill, debit note, udhaar mein return ka hisaab, aur ye sab GST report mein kaise jaata hai.

00:00:21.781 --> 00:00:26.330
Naya bill. Customer Manoj hain, inka apna GSTIN nahi hai.

00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:33.990
Lekin ye apni company ke liye saaman le rahe hain, aur company GST ka input credit claim karegi.

00:00:33.990 --> 00:00:37.661
Item jodte hain aur Complete bill dabate hain.

00:00:38.039 --> 00:00:46.671
Yahan B2B invoice ka switch hai. Isse on karte hain aur company ka naam, GSTIN aur address likhte hain.

00:00:46.671 --> 00:00:51.365
GSTIN ke pehle do ank se state apne aap pata chalti hai.

00:00:51.365 --> 00:00:58.656
Ye company Karnataka ki hai, isliye app khud IGST lagata hai, CGST aur SGST nahi. Kyun?

00:00:58.656 --> 00:01:06.199
Kyunki alag state ko bechne par IGST lagta hai, aur galat tax bill ko bekaar kar deta hai.

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:09.281
Fully paid aur Generate invoice.

00:01:09.281 --> 00:01:18.059
Dekhiye, invoice ABC Traders ke naam bana hai, unke GSTIN ke saath, aur place of supply Karnataka, IGST.

00:01:18.059 --> 00:01:22.279
Udhaar aur loyalty Manoj ke khate mein hi rahenge.

00:01:22.279 --> 00:01:32.660
Aur ye naam aur GSTIN bill par freeze ho jaate hain, customer ki details baad mein badlein to bhi purana bill nahi badalta.

00:01:33.039 --> 00:01:40.031
Ab maan lijiye bill mein price kam lag gayi thi. GST mein bana hua invoice badla nahi jaata.

00:01:40.031 --> 00:01:41.931
Iske liye Debit note hai.

00:01:41.931 --> 00:01:49.379
Bill par plus Debit note dabate hain, extra amount paanch sau, GST ki rate, aur wajah likhte hain.

00:01:49.379 --> 00:01:53.559
Customer ye paisa baad mein dega, isliye Add to udhaar.

00:01:53.938 --> 00:01:58.847
Issue debit note. Ye apna number wala document hai, D N series.

00:01:58.847 --> 00:02:04.380
Kis invoice ke against hai, extra value, IGST aur total, sab likha hai.

00:02:04.380 --> 00:02:11.548
Ye GST report ke Table nau B mein jaata hai aur customer ke udhaar mein jud jaata hai. Kyun?

00:02:11.548 --> 00:02:17.938
Kyunki GST mein har sudhaar ka alag kaagaz chahiye, chupke se badla hua bill nahi.

00:02:19.234 --> 00:02:25.321
Ulta case: customer saaman lautata hai aur paisa nahi leta, udhaar mein kam karwata hai.

00:02:25.321 --> 00:02:28.503
Return mein Adjust against credit chunte hain.

00:02:28.503 --> 00:02:35.074
Ab ye sirf label nahi, customer ka baaki sach mein kam hota hai, aur credit note bhi banta hai.

00:02:36.195 --> 00:02:43.772
Aur pichhle mahine ka bill. Ispar Edit aur Void ab nahi milte, kyunki wo mahina shayad file ho chuka hai.

00:02:43.772 --> 00:02:47.091
Sudhaar ke liye Return ya Debit note hi. Kyun?

00:02:47.091 --> 00:02:54.235
Kyunki file hue mahine ka bill chupke se badla, to CA ki report aur sarkari record mel nahi khaate.

00:02:59.107 --> 00:03:02.452
Restaurant mein company ki party ya lunch.

00:03:02.452 --> 00:03:09.779
Order ka Bill kholte hain, aur Company GST bill par company ka naam aur GSTIN likh kar Save.

00:03:09.779 --> 00:03:16.787
Bill par Bill to aur GSTIN chhapta hai, aur settle hone par ye B2B mein report hota hai.

00:03:17.183 --> 00:03:25.119
Hotel mein corporate guest. Check out par Company GST invoice ka option hai, company ka naam aur GSTIN.

00:03:25.119 --> 00:03:32.823
Hotel ka tax hotel ki jagah par lagta hai, isliye dusre state ki company ho to bhi CGST aur SGST hi.

00:03:36.401 --> 00:03:41.683
Ab GST report. G S T R 1 mein upar B2B aur B2C ka filter hai.

00:03:41.683 --> 00:03:49.995
B2B chunne par Table chaar mein wo bill dikhte hain jo kisi GSTIN ke naam bane, ABC Traders bhi.

00:03:49.995 --> 00:03:57.961
Table nau B mein credit notes aur debit notes. Har table ka CSV CA ko bhejne ke liye taiyar.

00:04:00.150 --> 00:04:08.493
Aur G S T R 3 B mein bhi B2B aur B2C ka hissa dikhta hai, credit note ghata ke aur debit note jod ke.

00:04:08.493 --> 00:04:19.150
Saath hi Table teen point do, dusre state ke bina GSTIN wale customers ki bikri, state ke hisaab se, jo 3 B mein bharni hoti hai.

00:04:27.851 --> 00:04:49.234
Aaj humne dekha: B2B switch se company ke GSTIN par bill, sahi state se IGST ya CGST, freeze hua naam, debit note se value badhana, return ko udhaar mein adjust karna, purane mahine ka lock, restaurant aur hotel mein company ka bill, aur GST report mein B2B aur B2C alag.

00:04:49.234 --> 00:04:56.887
Ek practical baat: business customer ka GSTIN hamesha bill banate waqt hi daliye, baad mein nahi.

00:04:56.887 --> 00:04:59.491
Wahi unka tax credit bachata hai.
